{
  "bodyHash": "b79f18287bfb959a",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6e325c15c598a49ce0b48e94913c50171ef7dd06_0.webp\" alt=\"post\"></p>\n<h1>來自過去的漣漪，但你從未見過的替身！</h1>\n<p>此擴充模組為《<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fripples-of-the-past\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ripples of the Past</a>》添加了數個原創替身。該模組是基於《<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjojowiki.com%252fJoJo_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JoJo 的奇妙冒險</a>》打造的 Minecraft 模組。</p>\n<h2>1.16.5</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;Ashes to Ashes</p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/962dd713db7688dc86a2122e4e5b2166e8073a71.png\" alt=\"stand icon\">Ashes to Ashes</h2>\n<p>Ashes to Ashes 是一種<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjojowiki.com%252fStand_Types%2523Multi-Unit_Stands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">群體替身</a>，具現化為數百隻由石灰灰色塵埃凝聚而成的脆弱飛蛾。這些飛蛾會從接觸到的任何移動物體中抽取動能，並將竊取的動量儲存於其「石化」的翅膀內。雖然單一單位缺乏精度，但它們可以觸發「地層釋放」——粉碎實體形態還原為塵埃，同時將所有累積的能量釋放出毀滅性的動能爆炸。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3f35b4f456fb2805b5995f3f27c63c85da73752e_0.webp\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_stand_map\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;攻擊&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5dd04910ff04fe6ba8dafd693ee40deffa12001f.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_moth_bite\"> 飛蛾啃噬 (Moth Gnaw)：命令塵埃形成的飛蛾啃咬附著的目標。傷害會根據附著在目標身上的飛蛾數量而增加。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b7507c6b7c0d1a72d338567d53019f89f6f243c2.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_moth_swarm_attack\"> 群體突襲 (Swarm attack)：指揮群體衝向目標並自動將其包圍。也可用於拾取物品。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li>（Shift 變體：<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/275a0fed39a076b3570a63eb0d31f80788001f0f_0.webp\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_moth_jet\"> 飛蛾噴射 (Moth Jet)：以高速發射集中的飛蛾流，黏附路徑上的任何目標。）</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2600e8cfbab42f927e519b96819a0b86cad4fad8.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_adhesion\"> 黏附 (Adhesion)：將飛蛾固定在實體或方塊上，持續抽取其動能。對實體而言，這會降低移動速度與攻擊力；對方塊而言，則會使其無法互動且無法被破壞。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li>（Shift 變體：<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3a3b8ac47d31e3e97a143e673fcaaf74e7685a50.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_kinetic_adhesion\"> 動能黏附 (Kinetic Adhesion)：附著完全充能的「琥珀」飛蛾，隨時準備立即引爆。）</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25287d555b58ef14458b4e119791c8c226ed4473.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_kinetic_piercing\"> 動能穿透 (Kinetic Piercing)：消耗儲存的能量，發射單隻飛蛾作為高速投射物，粉碎方塊並造成大量穿透傷害。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a6938cb92dd32363c1d39486058218c27e20b020.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_bullet_with_butterfly_wings\"> 蝶翼子彈 (Bullet with Butterfly Wings)：釋放整個群體進行高速齊射，以龐大的動能衝擊壓垮目標。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;能力&nbsp;</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>能力</p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/055c6f0832fc0c65cb818ea010593218e5c6ff51.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_swarm_shield\"> 群體護盾 (Swarm Shield)：讓石化石蛾環繞使用者旋轉，形成動能吸收場。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li>（Shift 變體：<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ce475271fd45ba6d6622c81a1bb6caeea0c638a0.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_swarm_guardian\"> 群體守護者 (Swarm Guardian)：將護盾投射至盟友身上以提供保護。）</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1196b4ea450ba7678cb95c7fd0125284ef18ae63.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_moth_recall\"> 飛蛾召回 (Moth Recall)：將最遠處的飛蛾召回至使用者身旁。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li>（Shift 變體：<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6e7d45173615a3a460ef6cac3bf0631f6779269f.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_swarm_recall\"> 群體召回 (Swarm Recall)：同時召回所有活躍的飛蛾。）</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1e0ace5b6820a9c5415ae06ccbb8bf2335a9c5b7.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_kinetic_detonation\"> 動能引爆 (Kinetic Detonation)：引發攜帶動能的所有飛蛾立即爆炸。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li>（Shift 變體：<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d6250a4dfddf464532009436d0662f49b2e25a5.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_exfoliating_detonation\"> 剝落引爆 (Exfoliating Detonation)：將飛蛾炸成濃厚的塵埃雲，減緩實體移動速度並快速耗盡其氧氣值。）</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f35ea616ed48ed22c06ccb6ac7ceb8d3bf7c095f.png\" alt=\"kinetic_sensing\"> 動能感知 (Kinetic Sensing)：利用飛蛾對運動的敏感性，高亮顯示附近所有移動中的目標。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8d63b5c117f857754f37a2e15d60fc31decff66e.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_frozen_barrier\"> 靜滯屏障 (Stasis Barrier)：部署一堵飛蛾牆，形成無法通行的動能屏障。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li>（Shift 變體：<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5c5075792cc97dc2f7c530f2dad9b3ba70c32d19.png\" alt=\"ashes_to_ashes_remove_barrier\"> 移除屏障 (Remove Barrier)：移除你正視線的屏障。你也可以透過「群體召回」來清除它們。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Thela Hun Ginjeet&nbsp;</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/27e947e31ad69dc86e186209f7a3eb1caaf1de2e.png\" alt=\"stand icon 2\">Thela Hun Ginjeet</h2>\n<p>Thela Hun Ginjeet 是一種<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjojowiki.com%252fStand_Types%2523Artificial_Non-Humanoid_Stands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">人工非人型替身</a>，外形為一根鏽蝕、長達兩公尺的黑色金屬欄杆長矛。一旦刺入目標體內，它會在血管系統中滋生內部倒鉤，並吞噬所有治療效果以作為自身生長的燃料。這會將任何恢復嘗試轉化為額外傷害與更嚴重的麻痺。此效果會持續存在，直到受害者對其他目標造成等量傷害，導致荊棘枯萎且替身返回使用者手中。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49224c843158d696c727d310d142452c0f42c221_0.webp\" alt=\"Thela Hun Ginjeet stand map\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;攻擊&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/30c5fbdf73a8fdb2ae047fd4db5a2b935041828f.png\" alt=\"thela_hun_ginjeet_swift_thrust\"> 迅捷突刺 (Swift Thrust)：使用金屬欄杆進行突刺攻擊。</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f946120d7bcb15936afaa48c80f38b7d409e0df5.png\" alt=\"thela_hun_ginjeet_sweep\"> 掃擊 (Sweep)：使用金屬欄杆進行掃擊攻擊。</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1e0ace5b6820a9c5415ae06ccbb8bf2335a9c5b7.png\" alt=\"thela_hun_ginjeet_thorn_burst\"> 荊棘爆發 (Thorn Burst)：在目標體內引爆長矛。造成致命傷害並射出大量碎片。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;能力&nbsp;</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>能力</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0fb4a04b3825683a01e6fc78ec2fb970d5ac441.png\" alt=\"thela_hun_ginjeet_block\"> 格擋 (Block)：進行格擋，但使用長矛進行反擊。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fd42a84e21d13bf55c9e9c662e89a2f5d7012b5f.png\" alt=\"thela_hun_ginjeet_recall\"> 召回 (Recall)：召回你的長矛。在召回過程中，亦可觸發刺入敵人體內的效應。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/72f6587bedce415894b317148342091677f9017c.png\" alt=\"thela_hun_ginjeet_grab_pull\"> 牽引拉拽 (Tether Pull)：將已被刺中的目標拉向自己。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b9f411494ea0247433a819e47c3e4a6d9ffdb2a0.png\" alt=\"thela_hun_ginjeet_grab_dash\"> 欄杆衝刺 (Railing Dash)：將使用者拉向長矛所在位置，實現高速移動與垂直跳躍。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;被動&nbsp;</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>被動</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <ul>\n  <li>行為模式：Thela Hun Ginjeet 作為一件專用武器運作，具有類似三叉戟的行為特性，支援近戰與投擲投射物攻擊。其攻擊傷害會動態隨替身的「破壞力」屬性成長。</li>\n  <li>血管寄生：投擲時，長矛會貫穿並留在目標實體體內。一旦固定，替身便會啟動寄生生長：吞噬所有收到的治療效果（例如藥水、金蘋果或再生效果）以驅動內部擴張。這會將所有恢復意圖轉化為額外傷害與加重的麻痺狀態，確保詛咒絕對生效，直到長矛被召回或債務償清為止。</li>\n  </ul>\n</blockquote>",
